  "summary": "Funk rock is a fusion genre that mixes elements of funk and rock. James Brown and others declared that Little Richard and his mid-1950s road band, the Upsetters, were the first to put the funk in the rock and roll beat, with a biographer stating that their music \"spark[ed] the musical transition from fifties rock and roll to sixties funk\".",
